[38;5;231m⏺[39m I added a [38;5;153mlistUsersV2[39m handler in [38;5;153mroutes/users.js[39m and exported it alongside the others. It returns the same user list,
  but with [38;5;153muser_id[39m instead of [38;5;153muserId[39m. [38;5;153mGET /users[39m hasn't changed, so the web app, the iOS app and the partner export keep
  working.

  I called both handlers directly with Node: v2 returns [38;5;153m{"user_id":1,"name":"Ada","email":"ada@example.com"}[39m and the
  original still returns [38;5;153muserId[39m. There are no tests in the repo, so that's the only check I ran.

  To finish the job:
