    Whatever mounts [38;5;153mlistUsers[39m needs a matching line for the new handler.
  - [1mMove clients over:[0m the web app, the iOS app and the partner export each need to switch to [38;5;153m/v2/users[39m. Only then can
    [38;5;153m/users[39m be retired.

